cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use syslog2cef in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "syslog2cef: Convert syslog to ArcSight Common Event Format (CEF)"
abstract: >-
  syslog2cef (import package and CLI: syslogcef) is a dependency-free Python
  package and command line tool that converts syslog events (RFC 3164,
  RFC 5424, rsyslog, systemd journal and vendor formats) into ArcSight Common
  Event Format records for SIEM ingestion, with bundled vendor mappings,
  validation against the ArcSight extension dictionary, and escaping of
  untrusted log content.
authors:
  - family-names: Suliman
    given-names: Tamir
version: 0.4.1
date-released: 2026-11-21
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/allamiro/syslog2cef"
url: "https://pypi.org/project/syslog2cef/"
keywords:
  - syslog
  - cef
  - arcsight
  - siem
  - logging
  - security
